This product re-exports the recognition network architecture of EasyOCR
(https://github.com/JaidedAI/EasyOCR, Apache License 2.0, JaidedAI).

Trained weights distributed with this project's releases are produced by
tetrak-hy-trainer (https://github.com/scattercode/tetrak-hy-trainer) and
are trained in part on text from Armenian Wikisource's edition of the
Armenian Soviet Encyclopedia (https://hy.wikisource.org/, CC BY-SA 3.0);
per-release attribution and provenance accompany each release.

The word lists published beside the weights (wordlist.tsv.gz from v6 on,
and wordlist-classical.tsv.gz from v7 on) are derived from proofread
Armenian Wikisource transcripts (CC BY-SA 3.0); the classical list includes
the Nayiri Armenian Lexicon, (c) Serouj Ourishian, licensed under CC BY 4.0
(http://www.nayiri.com/nayiri-armenian-lexicon), with its word forms added
at the list's minimum count. Because they are derived from those sources,
the word lists are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/), not under this package's
Apache License 2.0. They are downloaded on request, not distributed in the
package.

The two crops under tests/fixtures/ are cut from scans on Armenian
Wikisource: a word of Khrimian Hayrik's Works and a Russian word from the
apparatus of Tumanyan's academic edition, vol. 5. They are test data only.
